      en: ["The massive 'Star-Spangled Banner' flag that flew over the fort measured an incredible 30 by 42 feet.", "Fort McHenry was designed in a massive, five-pointed star shape to allow overlapping fields of defensive cannon fire.", "The massive British bombardment involved firing roughly 1,500 to 1,800 cannonballs, rockets, and mortar shells at the fort.", "Francis Scott Key witnessed the massive bombardment from a truce ship anchored securely behind the British fleet.", "The fort is uniquely designated as a massive National Monument and Historic Shrine, the only site to hold both titles.", "During the American Civil War, the massive fort was used as a prison to detain suspected Confederate sympathizers."]
